  "bodyHash": "b096e139a2b4f2a2",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Bundle. Made with love. Serilum's mods combined, for easier downloading!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the bundle\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>Spawn Bundle</strong> 是一種特殊類型的模組，它將 Serilum 的多個<strong>生成類型</strong>模組整合在一起。雖然我發現將我的模組分組非常困難，但我嘗試這樣做是為了讓它們更便於安裝。它使用一種稱為 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系統。這基本上意味著包含的模組保持完全獨立，同時允許像整合包一樣安裝它們。所有模組仍擁有各自的配置文件，並且你會在全遊戲模組列表中看到它們。</span><br><br><span>該整合包是整合包開發的額外輔助工具，但並不取代我个人偏好的模組化系統。然而，可以透過整合包的配置文件禁用包含的模組。<strong>更改生效需要重新啟動遊戲。</strong></span><br><br><span>由於 JiJ 系統的工作方式，它既兼容正常安裝該模組，也兼容與整合包中包含的模組並存。這主要可用於強制指定特定版本，但如果以這種方式意外重複安裝了模組，也不會造成問題。雖然這可能不是問題，但當然最好只安裝一次。因此，如果你決定安裝此整合包，可以移除任何屬於此整合包的其他模組。</span><br><br><span>我希望這個整合包對那些喜歡內容較大的模組的玩家有用。感謝大家多年來的支持！</span><br><br></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置選項：</p><details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary><span><strong>enableBoggedSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBreezeSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCaveSpiderSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGiantSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHuskSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMooshroomSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMooshroomTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMoreZombieVillagers</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableSkeletonHorseSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableStraySpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableZombieHorseSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableZombieVillagersFromSpawner</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Available Bundles\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下 Serilum 模組整合包可供使用：</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Client Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Customization Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Extra Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's QoL Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's RPG Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Spawn Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Mods included\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bogged-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bogged-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Bogged Spawn</a></td>\n<td>增加在所有地方自然生成 bogged 的機會，取代骷髏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/breeze-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/breeze-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Breeze Spawn</a></td>\n<td>增加在所有地方自然生成 breezes 的機會，取代烈焰人。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cave-spider-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cave-spider-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Cave Spider Spawn</a></td>\n<td>增加在地底自然生成洞穴蜘蛛的機會，取代蜘蛛。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/giant-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/giant-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Giant Spawn</a></td>\n<td>允許巨人自然生成，並具有自定義 AI（基於殭屍）和其他調整。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/husk-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/husk-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Husk Spawn</a></td>\n<td>增加在所有地方自然生成喪屍的機會，取代殭屍。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mooshroom-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mooshroom-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Mooshroom Spawn</a></td>\n<td>增加在所有地方自然生成蘑菇牛的機會，取代牛。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mooshroom-tweaks.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mooshroom-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">Mooshroom Tweaks</a></td>\n<td>允許紅色和棕色蘑菇牛在其生物群落中自然生成。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/more-zombie-villagers.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-zombie-villagers\" target=\"_blank\">More Zombie Villagers</a></td>\n<td>允許更改殭屍作為村民變體生成的默認機率。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/skeleton-horse-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/skeleton-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Skeleton Horse Spawn</a></td>\n<td>允許骷髏馬自然生成，並有骷髏騎在上面以及其他調整。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stray-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/stray-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Stray Spawn</a></td>\n<td>增加在所有地方自然生成流浪者的機會，取代骷髏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-horse-spawn.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\">Zombie Horse Spawn</a></td>\n<td>允許殭屍馬自然生成，並有殭屍騎在上面以及其他調整。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-villagers-from-spawner.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-villagers-from-spawner\" target=\"_blank\">Zombie Villagers From Spawner</a></td>\n<td>恢復刷怪籠生成村民變體的能力，該功能在 1.11 中被移除。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
